#: templates/public/about.html:4
msgid "Mejas Microfinance - Kuhusu Sisi"
msgstr "Mejas Microfinance - About Us"

#: templates/public/about.html:15
msgid "Kuhusu Mejas Enterprises"
msgstr "About Mejas Enterprises"

#: templates/public/about.html:18
msgid "Kuhusu Sisi & Maadili Yetu ya Msingi"
msgstr "About Us & Our Core Values"

#: templates/public/about.html:26
msgid "Sisi ni Nani?"
msgstr "Who are we?"

#: templates/public/about.html:29
msgid ""
"Mejas Enterprises ni taasisi ya kifedha inayojitolea kutoa huduma za mikopo "
"ya kiwango kidogo na cha kati (Microfinance) ili kuwawezesha wajasiriamali, "
"vikundi vya kijamii, na watu binafsi kukuza biashara zao na kufikia malengo "
"yao ya kiuchumi nchini Tanzania."
msgstr ""

#: templates/public/about.html:32
msgid ""
"Kupitia Mfumo wetu mpya wa MMS (Microfinance Management System), tunaleta "
"huduma zote za uendeshaji katika ulimwengu wa kidigitali ili kuongeza "
"ufanisi wa huduma, kurahisisha marejesho ya mikopo na kuleta uwazi kamili "
"kwa wateja wetu na wadau wote."
msgstr ""

#: templates/public/about.html:43
msgid "Maono Yetu (Vision)"
msgstr "Our Vision"

#: templates/public/about.html:45
msgid ""
"Kuwa taasisi inayoongoza nchini kwa kutoa suluhu rahisi, za haraka na za "
"kidigitali za kifedha kwa jamii zote, tukiwa na mchango chanya kwenye kukuza "
"uchumi na kuondoa umaskini."
msgstr ""

#: templates/public/about.html:54
msgid "Lengo Letu Kuu (Mission)"
msgstr "Our Core Goal (Mission)"

#: templates/public/about.html:56
msgid ""
"Kurahisisha upatikanaji wa mikopo salama kwa wajasiriamali wadogo na wa kati "
"kupitia ubunifu wa kidigitali, huduma bora za wateja, na usimamizi madhubuti "
"wa rasilimali fedha."
msgstr ""

#: templates/public/about.html:64
msgid "Maadili yetu ya Msingi (Core Values)"
msgstr "Core Values"

#: templates/public/about.html:69
msgid "Uwazi (Transparency)"
msgstr "Transparency"

#: templates/public/about.html:70
msgid "Mahesabu na riba wazi bila gharama zilizofichika."
msgstr "Clear calculations and interest with no hidden costs."

#: templates/public/about.html:74
msgid "Uaminifu (Integrity)"
msgstr "Integrity"

#: templates/public/about.html:75
msgid "Kutunza siri na mikataba ya wateja kwa weledi wa juu."
msgstr "Preserve client secrets and contracts with high professionalism."

#: templates/public/about.html:79
msgid "Ufanisi (Efficiency)"
msgstr "Efficiency"

#: templates/public/about.html:80
msgid "Utoaji na kuidhinisha mikopo kwa muda mfupi zaidi."
msgstr "Disbursement and approval of loans in the shortest time."

#: templates/public/about.html:84
msgid "Usalama (Security)"
msgstr "Security"

#: templates/public/about.html:85
msgid "Kuhifadhi data na miamala kwa njia salama na msimbo."
msgstr "Store data and transactions in a safe, encrypted format."

#: templates/public/about.html:93
msgid "Usimamizi wa Majukumu ya Watumiaji (User Roles)"
msgstr "User Roles Management"

#: templates/public/about.html:96
msgid ""
"Mfumo wa MMS umejengwa kwa kuzingatia mgawanyo wa majukumu (Role-Based "
"Access Control) ili kuhakikisha kila mtumiaji anaona tu kile anachostahili "
"kulingana na kazi yake:"
msgstr ""

#: templates/public/about.html:104
msgid ""
"Ana mamlaka kamili ya kuona taarifa zote, ripoti za jumla za kifedha, "
"utendaji wa matawi na maamuzi makubwa ya uwekezaji."
msgstr ""

#: templates/public/about.html:110
msgid "Meneja (Manager)"
msgstr "Manager"

#: templates/public/about.html:111
msgid ""
"Anahusika na kuidhinisha maombi ya mikopo, kusimamia kazi za kila siku za "
"ofisi na watumishi (Officers na Cashier), pamoja na kupata ripoti."
msgstr ""

#: templates/public/about.html:118
msgid ""
"Hufanya malipo (disbursement), anapokea marejesho ya mikopo (payment "
"collection) na kufanya hesabu ya siku kila siku (End of Day reconciliation)."
msgstr ""

#: templates/public/about.html:124
msgid "Afisa Mikopo (Loan Officer)"
msgstr "Loan Officer"

#: templates/public/about.html:125
msgid ""
"Anasajili wateja wapya, anajaza fomu za maombi, na kufuatilia marejesho ya "
"wateja wake kila siku kwenye uwanja wa kazi."
msgstr ""

#: templates/public/about.html:132
msgid ""
"Anaona historia ya mkopo wake, salio lake la sasa la deni, na ratiba nzima "
"ya marejesho inayofuata."
msgstr ""

